  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at v0.32.0 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### 🔧 Other Changes\n* feat(autopilot): origin-aware skills with CODEOWNERS-safe review by @sergio-sisternes-epam in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3003\n* perf(cli): lazy-load heavyweight command modules by @sergio-sisternes-epam in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3001\n* fix(alias): reject path-traversing dependency aliases — fixes #2900 by @Danvs60 in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2901\n* fix(ci): repair advisory locks and platform regressions by @danielmeppiel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3021\n* fix(update): preserve marketplace uninstall aliases by @mfroembgen in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2949\n* Bump setuptools to 83.0.0 to remediate Unicode MANIFEST exclusion bypass by @sergio-sisternes-epam with @Copilot in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2893\n* feat(autopilot): maintainer canvas, panel-mode, and comment writer by @sergio-sisternes-epam in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3024\n* fix(install): shorten staging path segments to clear Windows MAX_PATH by @MohammedAlkindi in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2941\n* fix(installer): correct prebuilt Linux glibc minimum to 2.38 by @danielmeppiel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2931\n* fix(update): preserve deployment targets during partial updates by @Wanming08 in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2924\n* fix(hooks): map prompt-submit to Copilot's userPromptSubmitted by @sheilagithub in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3030\n* fix(marketplace): authenticate default-host checks by @yfoel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2917\n* fix(deps): reject incompatible immutable requirements by @danielmeppiel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3061\n* fix(prune): detect orphan skills and preserve retained bundles by @fangkangmi in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3057\n* chore: release v0.32.0 by @danielmeppiel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3080\n* fix(tests): repair v0.32.0 release validation contracts by @danielmeppiel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3081\n\n## New Contributors\n* @Danvs60 made their first contribution in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2901\n* @Wanming08 made their first contribution in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2924\n* @sheilagithub made their first contribution in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/3030\n* @yfoel made their first contribution in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2917\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/microsoft/apm/compare/v0.31.0...v0.32.0",
